Cell["\<\
CLM expands L = Sum[K^(j-2) L_(j), j >= 2] in Eq. (2.9). Therefore lag3CLM \
transcribes the coefficient L_(3) in Eq. (2.16), without the coupling K. \
Indices are translated from CLM's flat-space delta notation to eta \
contractions.

In the scanned Eq. (2.16), the first term in the second group has \
inconsistent index multiplicities. The index-consistent reading used here is \
phi_{mu tau} phi_{mu sigma,lambda} phi_{lambda tau,sigma}. This explicit \
transcription choice is part of the reference definition.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cc1e8b8e-5780-4b5d-b1e8-cb6e2c2060a6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
