Cell["\<\
This result can be inserted in eqs. (3.4)-(3.5) of F. T. Brandt and D. G. C. \
McKeon, Phys. Rev. D 93, 105037 (2016), arXiv:1601.04944, the Palatini \
action, to yield:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{4.001169992768228*^9, 
  4.0011700571298656`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"9a8dbcdb-bbf5-465e-a60d-\
b9e0ad6d0e26"],

